# Tastatur

> <%= Tastatur::DESCRIPTION %>

The marketing page, the documentation and the FAQ are also served as markdown: fetch the `.md` URLs below directly, or request the HTML paths with `Accept: text/markdown`.

## Docs

- [What Tastatur is](<%= markdown_root_url %>): the marketing page — what it measures, how an anonymous visit is counted, and what it will not claim
- [Documentation](<%= docs_url(format: :md) %>): install, script options, custom events, revenue, single-page apps, goals, funnels, Content Security Policy, the server-side HTTP API, opt-out, and what gets collected
- [Frequently asked questions](<%= faq_url(format: :md) %>): consent banners, GDPR, what happens to visitor IP addresses, why cookieless visitor counts differ from Google Analytics, ad blockers, self-hosting, and when a data processing agreement is needed
- [Revenue attribution](<%= revenue_url(format: :md) %>): which channel produces paying customers — the two-ledger design, the three integration steps with code, and the read-only Stripe connection

